  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7685d6df252bcaf469e83042a64f6d39, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dad
  name: Dad
  IdleReplices:
  - What are you doing, you shameless bastard?! Release us at once!
  - You are a disgrace to this family! Cursed be you! Cursed be all your descendants!
  - I should never have let that damned snake near you. Never!
  - A family is built on respect... and you tore it apart with your own hands.
  - I raised you to stand straight, not to kneel before monsters.
  HoverReplices:
  - What is there to think about?! Just refuse the Shaitan! You cannot betray your
    ancestors like this!
  - Look at what you've become... was this worth it?
  DragReplices:
  - Yes... then do me a favor. End this humiliation and kill me already.
  PutInReplices:
  - Finally... at the end, you have sinned, my son. A great sin. One that cannot
    be washed away. But you are still my son. And I will carry this sin with you.
  bonusDescription: 
  speedBonus: 1.5
  tiltMaxAngleBonus: 1.3
  tiltSpeedBonus: 1.2
